---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - US Emergency Local Hub">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-primary mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none leading-relaxed space-y-4 text-gray-700">
      <p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> July 29, 2026</p>
      <p>US Emergency Local Hub ("we," "our," or "us") operates the website LocalRestoreHub.com. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary mt-8">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We collect minimal information when you use our directory service:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
        <li><strong>Usage Data:</strong> Pages visited, city searches, and referral sources via anonymous analytics.</li>
        <li><strong>Contact Information:</strong> If you voluntarily reach out via our contact form, we collect your name and email.</li>
        <li><strong>Call Tracking:</strong> We may record that a call was placed through our directory for quality assurance purposes.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary mt-8">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
        <li>To connect you with local service providers.</li>
        <li>To improve our directory and user experience.</li>
        <li>To comply with legal obligations.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary mt-8">3. Information Sharing</h2>
      <p>We do not sell your personal information. We may share aggregated, anonymized data with partners for analytics purposes. If you call a number listed on our site, your call is routed to an independent third-party service provider.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary mt-8">4. Cookies</h2>
      <p>We use minimal, essential cookies for site functionality. No tracking cookies are used for advertising purposes at this time.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary mt-8">5. Contact</h2>
      <p>For questions about this policy, please contact us through the information provided on our Contact page.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
